# Simple Accounting — PRD v1

Internal ops app for catalog pricing and early procurement workflow. Guests can search the public catalog landing at `/`. All other modules remain auth-gated.

## Actors

- **Guest:** Public catalog landing at `/` — search live products for selling price, availability, unit, description, and categories. No write access; no `purchase_price` or stock quantities. Login page for admin entry.
- **Admin:** Single seeded account (via `DatabaseSeeder`). Full access to implemented modules after session login. No public registration.

## App shell

- Layout: `AppLayout` — site header + sidebar nav + main panel (authenticated); public landing uses slim `PublicLayout` (header only)
- Auth: session login/logout; `/` is the public catalog for guests and logged-in users; authenticated ops dashboard is `/dashboard`; login lands on `/dashboard`; Products remains `/products`
- Flash feedback: server `Inertia::flash('toast', { type, message })` → Sonner via `FlashToaster`

### Cross-device UX

- **Supported:** tablet (~768px+) and desktop — primary design targets
- Every screen, table, form, modal, and control must remain **visible and fully functional** on tablet and larger
- Phone layouts are best-effort; do not regress tablet/desktop for phone-only tweaks

### Nav modules

| Module | Route | Status |
|--------|-------|--------|
| Catalog (public) | `/` | Shipped — search price & availability; Soft Flat landing (guests and auth) |
| Dashboard | `/dashboard` | Shipped — sales + procurement KPIs, daily sales chart, needs-attention (including collect payment) |
| Products | `/products` | Shipped — search/browse panel (includes stock; cost via admin edit) |
| Suppliers | `/suppliers` | Shipped — full CRUD |
| Customers | `/customers` | Shipped — full CRUD |
| Sales Orders | `/sales-orders` | Shipped — multi-line outbound sale; stock out on save; void restores stock |
| Request Quotations | `/request-quotations` | Shipped — list + create/edit tabs, soft delete, draft → pending → approved |
| Purchased Orders | `/purchased-orders` | Shipped — RFQ→PO, draft → ordered → received, prepayments, post to AP |
| Inventory | `/inventory` | Shipped — on-hand stock + movement ledger; receive posts stock from PO; sales post `sale` movements |
| Accounts | `/accounts-payable` | Shipped — settle posted POs by supplier |

Admin product management lives under `/admin/products` (also auth-gated). `/received-orders` redirects to `/inventory`.

