## Domain — Product

| Field | Rules |
|-------|--------|
| `name` | Required |
| `description` | Nullable text |
| `quantity` | Integer ≥ 0 |
| `categories` | Many-to-many (`categories` + `category_product`) |
| `purchase_price` | Decimal; **admin-only** — never on `/products` browse props |
| `selling_price` | Decimal; visible on browse + admin |
| `status` | Enum: `available` \| `unavailable` \| `discontinued` |
| Soft delete | `deleted_at`; trashed products hidden from browse panel |

### Products UX

- **Public landing (`/` guest):** Search by name/description; category tiles; results via `toCatalogArray()` (no `quantity`, no `purchase_price`); detail modal; only `available` products
- **Browse (`/products`):** Auth-gated search/browse; list may include quantity; cost stays in admin edit (`toAdminArray` / admin fields)
- **Admin (`/admin/products`):** CRUD + soft delete / restore; category assign; full fields including `purchase_price`
- Soft-deleted products stay out of browse and public landing

