## Domain — Request Quotation

| Field | Rules |
|-------|--------|
| `reference` | Unique UUID; auto-generated (client preview or server fallback) |
| `supplier_id` | Required; must be an active, non-deleted supplier |
| `status` | Enum: `draft` \| `pending` \| `approved` — new records start as `draft` |
| `grand_total` | Decimal; **server-calculated** from line subtotals |
| `notes` | Nullable text |
| Soft delete | `deleted_at`; trash filters on index |

### Request Quotations UX

- Single index page (`/request-quotations`) with two tabs: **list** (default) and **create/edit**
- List: ordered pending → approved → draft, newest within status; shows reference, supplier, item count, grand total, status, created date
- Trash filter (`trashed=only|with`); soft delete + restore; toast flash on mutations
- Workflow actions: Draft → Submit (pending), Pending → Approve
- Edit: draft and pending only (approved is locked); reuses create form on the create/edit tab
- Create: searchable supplier + product pickers; editable buying price/qty lines; live subtotals and grand total; save as draft
- Routes: `index`, `store`, `update`, `destroy`, `request-quotations.restore`, `request-quotations.submit`, `request-quotations.approve`
- Soft-deleted suppliers/products excluded from pickers; existing quotations still show related names via `withTrashed`

