## Domain — Inventory

| Field / concept | Rules |
|-----------------|-------|
| `products.quantity` | Cached on-hand balance; ≥ 0 |
| `stock_movements` | Append-only ledger: `receipt` \| `adjustment` \| `sale` |
| `quantity_delta` | Signed int; receipts from PO receive are positive |
| `quantity_after` | Snapshot after apply |
| `unit_cost` | Set on receipts from PO line buying price |
| `reference` | Polymorphic; PO receipts reference `purchased_order` |

### Inventory UX

- Single index page (`/inventory`) with tabs: **On hand** (default) and **Movements**
- On hand: search, category filter, sortable name/qty; row action **Adjust stock** (modal)
- Movements: search, type filter; shows delta, after, unit cost, PO reference, created by
- Receiving remains on Purchased Orders (`mark-received-with-adjustment`); posts receipt movements and increments on-hand in the same transaction
- Sales Orders post `sale` movements (negative delta) on create; void restores stock with compensating positive `sale` movements
- Admin product create/update quantity writes adjustment / opening-balance movements
- Routes: `inventory.index`, `inventory.adjust`

