## Domain — Sales Order

| Field / concept | Rules |
|-----|----|
| `reference` | Unique UUID; auto-generated |
| `customer_id` | Nullable; active customer when set (`null` = walk-in) |
| `grand_total` | Decimal; **server-calculated** from line subtotals |
| `notes` | Nullable text |
| `amount_paid` / `balance_due` | Derived from `sales_order_payments`; not stored on the order |
| `payment_status` | `unpaid` \| `partial` \| `paid` |
| Payments | Partial OK; walk-in cash only; customer: Cash, PDC, Bank Transfer, Online Payment |
| Soft delete | Void soft-deletes and restores stock; restore re-decrements if stock allows |
| Line `selling_price` | Defaults from product; overridable |
| Line `quantity` | Integer ≥ 1; must not exceed on-hand on create/restore |

### Sales Orders UX

- Single index page (`/sales-orders`) with **list** + **create** tabs (no edit after save)
- List: Unpaid / Partial / Paid chip; 3-dot **Add Payment** then **Void** (Void only while unpaid); trash filter; detail modal
- Detail: payment list + void payment; Add Payment while balance remains
- Create: optional customer, product lines, live totals; save posts stock immediately
- Routes: `index`, `store`, `destroy`, `sales-orders.restore`, `sales-orders.payments.store`, `sales-orders.payments.destroy`

