## Out of scope (v1)

Multi-user roles, public registration, public/guest catalog, multi-tenant, mobile API, warehouses/lots/serials, partial multi-receipt receiving, Accounts Receivable, COGS costing, draft/confirm sales workflow.

## Recommended next (v1.x)

- Accounts Receivable
- Low-stock alerts and price history polish
- Policies/gates even with one admin
- Pagination/empty-state polish across modules
